<title>BELGIUM: Ostend air cargo shows small rise in March 1997.</title>
<headline>Ostend air cargo shows small rise in March 1997.</headline>
<dateline>OSTEND 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend air cargo rose by 325 tonnes in March this year compared to the same month in 1996, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>				 March 97   March 96</p>
<p>  Cargo (tonnes)	   8,984	8,659</p>
<p>  Passenger traffic	9,131	9,117</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
